{
  "Npcs.DullahanHorse.Desc": "Racing across the battlefield on a black horse is a cloaked knight. You can't make out any of its features, though it is obviously humanoid. It wields a massive scythe which, combined with its fast steed makes for a terrifyingly effective opponent. You can't see its face, but whenever you look at where it should be, a shiver runs down your spine."
  "Npcs.DullahanHorse.Name": "Dark Knight"
}
